            <img src="/images/products/vellee-guest-presents.png" alt="thumb2" class="thumb"
              onclick="changeImage(this)">
            <img src="/images/products/vellee-guest-presents.png" alt="thumb2" class="thumb"
              onclick="changeImage(this)">
            <img src="/images/products/vellee-guest-presents.png" alt="thumb2" class="thumb"
              onclick="changeImage(this)"> -->

          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Right: Product Info -->
      <div class="col-md-6 product-info">
        <div>
          <h3 class="font-cormorant fw-bold">Табелки за врата</h3>
          <p><strong>Персонализирани табелки за дома на булката и младоженеца.</strong></p>
